        "text": "Deploying agents and adopting computers Rolling the agent out to many computers at once — from Group Policy, Intune, another RMM, or a Linux or macOS script — and assigning the computers that arrive to the right business (0.57). Everything on this page is Platform Admin only . A Business Owner adds computers one at a time from Devices → Add device , with a single use code, exactly as before; nothing about that changed."
