        "text": "Limit Value Why Message length 2,000 characters, refused, never cut Enforced in the API, the database ( ) and the agent. Counted in UTF 16 code units (0.44), the way a browser's counts, so an emoji outside the basic plane counts as two File size 10 MB a file Refused with 413 ( ); the upload stops being read past the limit Files per chat 20 files, 50 MB in all / (409); claimed in one conditional update, so two uploads at once cannot both pass File name 120 characters Cut, keeping the extension Technician messages 20 a minute per conversation Rate limit ( , 429) Replies from the computer 20 a minute per conversation, 30 a minute per computer Rate limit; the window also refuses past 20 a minute Messages per conversation 1,000 Then start a new chat Control characters Dropped, both ways C0/C1 controls, ESC, DEL, bidirectional overrides and isolates, line and paragraph separators. Tabs and newlines are kept; at most 20 newlines in a row Inactivity Two hours with no message ends the chat ( ) So a forgotten chat does not keep a window open Chat host lifetime 12 hours, then it exits; the next heartbeat starts it again if the chat is still open Text is stored as entered (after dropping control characters) and rendered as text in both places. The portal never treats it as HTML or markdown."
