        "text": "MSP technicians Added in v0.20. An MSP technician supports several customer businesses but belongs to none of them. Until v0.20 the only ways to give such a person access were to make them a Platform Admin (every business, every setting) or a member of one business (one business, nothing else). Technician assignments sit between the two. They give one person, or a group, defined access to one business, optionally to some of its computers, optionally only for a while or during set hours. Every grant is recorded and can be revoked."
