        "text": "Single sign on with Keycloak 0.59 \"Agit8or Identity P0\". Not yet run against a real Keycloak. Everything Rem0te does here is proven against a mock OpenID provider ( ). The Keycloak steps below follow Keycloak 26's documentation and have not been tried on this server. Check each one before relying on it. This is the setup for trusting a self hosted Keycloak as the sign in provider. The general rules are in sign in.md; this page is the Keycloak side and what to type into Rem0te."
